= Alexandria Ocasio-Cortez

AOC is a New York Congresswoman who holds significant sway over the Socialist wing. She is a emmber of the Democratic Socialists of America.

- @mobilize
- @organize
- @dsa_relations
- @root: Return to main

@mobilize
title: Mobilizong younger voters
subtitle: -1 resource - AOC is very effective at increasing Democratic turnout among young voters.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0 and resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if resources < 1 : We don't have enough resources! ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; socialist_strength += 7; socialist_dissent += 2

We have increased our mobilization efforts among younger voters.

@organize
title: Organizing Hispanic voters
subtitle: -1 resource - Though older Hispanic voters are skeptical, AOC polls very well with younger Hispanic voters. This is useful.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0 and resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if resources < 1 : We don't have enough resources! ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; socialist_strength += 3

We have increased our campaigning among Hispanic voters.

@dsa_relations
title: Relations with the DSA
subtitle: How should we deal with the Socialist organization?
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
