@defense
title: We must defend the established Democratic lawmakers against DSA insurgents.
subtitle: This could have the effect of radicalizing the group even further!
on-arrival: socialist_strength -= 10; socialist_dissent += 10; populism -= 5

We have focused on protecting Establishment candidates against insurgents.

@cooperate
title: We should cooperate more with DSA. They *are* the future of the party.
subtitle: The Establishment won't like this.
on-arrival: socialist_strength += 5; socialist_dissent -= 10; populism += 5

We have expanded our cooperation with the Democratic Socialists.

@ignore
title: The DSA can be ignored for now
subtitle: Can they?
on-arrival: socialist_strength += 10; socialist_dissent += 5; populism += 5
